Species
13 species are currently accepted:
Schefflera balansana {{small|Baill.}} – New Caledonia
Schefflera candelabrum {{small|Baill.}} – New Caledonia
Schefflera coenosa {{small|(R.Vig.) Frodin}} – southeastern New Caledonia, including Isle of Pines
Schefflera digitata {{small|J.R.Forst. & G.Forst.}} – New Zealand
Schefflera euthytricha {{small|A.C.Sm.}} – Fiji
Schefflera kerchoveiana {{small|(Veitch ex W.Richards) Frodin & Lowry}} – Vanuatu
Schefflera leratii {{small|R.Vig.}} – New Caledonia
Schefflera neoebudica {{small|Guillaumin}} – Vanuatu
Schefflera ouveana {{small|(Däniker) Frodin}} – New Caledonia (Loyalty Islands)
Schefflera pseudocandelabrum {{small|R.Vig.}} – New Caledonia
Schefflera samoensis {{small|(A.Gray) Harms}} – Samoa
Schefflera vieillardii {{small|Baill.}} – New Caledonia
Schefflera vitiensis {{small|(A.Gray) Seem.}} – Fiji

Fossil record
Two fossil fruits of †Schefflera dorofeevii have been extracted from bore hole samples of the Middle Miocene fresh water deposits in Nowy Sacz Basin, West Carpathians, Poland.
